            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThese quotes are updated on a regular basis, at different intervals. If you have any questions, please reach out to \u003Ca target=\u0022\u0022 data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022mailto:helpdesk@ggusd.us\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003E\u003Cu\u003Ehelpdesk@ggusd.us\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/a\u003E or ext. 77180.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFor unlisted items, please check the current approved vendors and resellers websites for listings for a variety of peripherals, this includes\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECDW-G (\u003Ca target=\u0022\u0022 data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://cdwg.com\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003Ehttps://cdwg.com\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDell (\u003Ca target=\u0022\u0022 data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://dell.com\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003Ehttps://dell.com\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESupplyMaster (\u003Ca target=\u0022\u0022 data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://supplymaster.com/\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003Ehttps://supplymaster.com/\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETo see the latest additions, changes, and updates to the Quotes page, please \u003Ca target=\u0022\u0022 data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://it.ggusd.us/it/support/it-quotes-update-log/\u0022 title=\u0022IT Quotes Update Log\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003E\u003Cu\u003Eclick here\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
